# Upstream LinStab2D reference checkout (not bundled; point
# LINSTABPY_BASEFLOW_DATA_DIR at a local clone of
# https://github.com/LinStab2D/LinStab2D, or place .mat files here directly).
# No trailing slash: `baseflows` is often a symlink to a local checkout, and a
# directory-only pattern (`baseflows/`) does not match a symlink, leaving the
# data/ dir perpetually untracked in `git status`.
src/linstabpy/data/baseflows

